{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent nonauthor merged-SHA review receipt, part 6/6 (22 rows; 142 total). Reviewer session: resume-group03-20261023. Immutable before: b65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd. Reviewed signed candidate: b46efb88356c0d78ee726007b12a62d4feae6ffe. Exact Gerrit 3096 merged SHA: 5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89. All 28 grouped changed path blobs, including generated docs/env-vars.md, are byte-identical candidate→merged. Every selected row has directives, semantic preservation, and bloat removal PASS with a strict word reduction. Complete 142-row TSV SHA-256: 02e042abbe56804e72d174b1f2b63f9a826f37affa92238e25552c9aef9ec1e9.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:in_flight_reviews@97-104\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:97-104\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:61-62\tReturn reviews currently executing through webhook or backfill. The health and deploy paths use this count to avoid interrupting work.\tPASS\t71\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_voter_error@136-139\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:136-139\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:94-95\tEmit one greppable VOTER_ERROR line on stderr plus a structured log body, without double-counting the marker.\tPASS\t45\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_publish_voter_error_metric@159-163\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:159-163\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:115-116\tPublish voter_errors to CloudWatch best-effort. The journald marker remains available when container credentials or network access fail.\tPASS\t56\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:module@175-178\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:175-178\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:128-129\tUse the runner's token fields from coverage metrics for usage observability.\tPASS\t30\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_publish_token_usage_metrics@189-195\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:189-195\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:140-142\tPublish available review token totals to CloudWatch best-effort. Missing fields contribute zero. No data skips publication. The journald usage marker remains the fallback.\tPASS\t74\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_emit_token_usage@215-220\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:215-220\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:162-163\tEmit one LLM_TOKEN_USAGE stderr marker and try CloudWatch. Accounting failures cannot change an already cast vote.\tPASS\t69\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_extract@238-242\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:238-242\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:181-182\tExtract change, project, revision, and ref from a patchset event. Return None when required fields are missing.\tPASS\t44\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:review_and_vote@272-283\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:272-283\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:212-214\tRun the shared webhook and backfill voter under in-flight accounting. Return a status record for skipped, deferred, voted, or failed work. Failures remain fail-closed and never cast a maximum vote.\tPASS\t95\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_decision_for_clone@300-308\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:300-308\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:231-233\tFetch the cloned revision's merge or ordinary diff and run the adapter. Pass revision for tree-to-vote binding. Return decision and reviewed diff for later artifact fingerprinting.\tPASS\t83\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_decision_for_clone@323-326\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:323-326\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:248-249\tRoute merge revisions around bare /patch, which returns 409. Log the guard when it selects the auto-merge delta.\tPASS\t43\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_guard_decision_auth@400-403\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:400-403\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:323-324\tRefuse before dedup, clone, or provider calls when Gerrit voting auth is blank. Emit VOTER_ERROR and never substitute another principal.\tPASS\t52\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_resolve_review_runtime@413-416\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:413-416\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:334-335\tUse the supplied provider runtime or compose it from receiver config for the decision path.\tPASS\t44\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_handle_retryable_gap@429-433\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:429-433\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:348-350\tDefer retryable coverage gaps without a vote while attempts remain. After exhaustion, non-disk gaps block with -1. Low disk remains a terminal no-vote deferral.\tPASS\t38\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::D:_superseded_before_vote@511-518\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:511-518\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:428-429\tSuppress a vote when Gerrit reports a newer current revision before posting. Manual reruns and failed currency lookups proceed.\tPASS\t93\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@616-623\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:616-623\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:527-529\tDetect merges after the existing-vote guard and before diff fetch. All entry paths share this decision. Merge REST failure becomes a visible fail-closed coverage-gap vote.\tPASS\t105\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@633-636\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:633-636\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:539-539\tLog merge detection for every change so path selection is visible.\tPASS\t50\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@663-666\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:663-666\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:566-567\tA proven checkout-revision mismatch permits no vote, including -1. The reviewed tree is not the patchset receiving the label.\tPASS\t48\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@701-708\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:701-708\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:602-604\tRecheck revision currency before voting because review may outlast a newer patchset. Suppress proven stale votes, but proceed on lookup failure or a current-revision manual rerun.\tPASS\t98\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@712-715\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:712-715\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:608-609\tPost the vote and valid inline findings. On inline rejection, retry message-only with a notice so finding text remains visible.\tPASS\t44\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@727-730\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:727-730\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:621-622\tTreat Gerrit 409 for a closed change as terminal. Record the skip without a VOTER_ERROR or retry.\tPASS\t53\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@765-767\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:765-767\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:657-658\tRecord merge path and parent count with the vote. A failed commit fetch uses -1 as parent count.\tPASS\t39\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/voter.py::C:_review_and_vote@775-783\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:775-783\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:666-668\tAfter voting, record a best-effort code_review artifact in the ambient ticket store and link trailer-cited tickets. Offload its synchronous store write so shutdown and health remain responsive.\tPASS\t104\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792822768638987279,"uuid":"f007132c-b372-4429-8b9f-6f762f0538aa"}